 very safe statement to make  so in summary i think  yeah um this is my last slide  yeah omics have rapidly become the heart  of drug discovery there's no question  protein targets are the basis of 90 per  plus percent of the drugs uh as you can  see mutations in the protein targets can  cause dramatic changes escape mutations  and proteomics is pretty much useful in  target selection drug selection  mechanism action so long story short uh  you know long-lived omics because of  omics i think the likelihood of success  of drug discovery is going to  dramatically increase so thank you very  much for your time um i don't know if i  exceeded by a couple of minutes or so i  don't know  yeah i did but  don't kill me for that please  i'm done  it was definitely a wonderful talk uh  we have a lot of questions i'll mail you  out sir and then we'll get back to our  participants with those questions  absolutely no problem at all yeah all  right thank you  it was fun being here thank you sonalika  yeah
 

